<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86436" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰγών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a ceremonial parade of actors,</i> etc., <i>preceding
				dramatic contests</i> at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.67
			</span></i> (cf. Sch.ad loc.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.780.16
			</span></i> (pl.), <u>Vit.Eur.</u>; title of play by <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				461
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>preliminary contest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαγῶνας προαγωνιστέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					796d
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(9).189.23
			</span></i> (Eretria, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				11
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαγῶνας ἀεὶ κατασκευάζων αὑτῷ
					τῆσδε τῆς γραφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					22.59
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προάγων</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
			</span></i> Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.729
			</span></i>.)</div>
